<title>GREECE: GENOP-DEH UNION CALLS FOR 24-HOUR STRIKE AT END-MARCH.</title>
<headline>GENOP-DEH UNION CALLS FOR 24-HOUR STRIKE AT END-MARCH.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The largest trade union of Greek state Public Power Corporation(DEH), GENOP-DEH, called for a 24-hour strike at end-March and another 48-hour strike in the first 10 days of April to protest against DEH's intransigence over pay and insurance matters, it said.</p>
<p>GENOP-DEH will launch a campaign to inform DEH workers and the public over its positions on collective bargaining in 1997, it said in a statement. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
